WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.101 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Guys, we are back.

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:03.036 line:92%
The winter Olympics are over.

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
Our show is back on.
Woo!

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.340 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.375 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Feels good!

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
Last night was
the closing ceremony

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the winter Olympics,
and they had some crazy stuff.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.714
I don't know if you saw it.
They had a big conga line.

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:15.648 line:92%
They had a giant snow globe.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.952
They had glow-in-the-dark pandas
on roller skates.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.254 size:88% position:44%
When asked what inspired
the pandas, they said,

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.122 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Uh, shrooms."

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.059 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
With the Olympics over,
90 countries

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.863 line:92%
have departed South Korea.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.431 line:92%
Yep, 90 groups waving goodbye,

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
or as the NRA
calls those, sponsors.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:38.405 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
The big winner
this year was Norway.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:43.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
They won a record 39 medals.
Wow.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:46.212 size:84% position:42%
Or, one for each person
who lives in Norway.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:46.746 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So there you go.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:51.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Jorgen, Bjorn,
Jornbjorgen, Jonborgen."

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is exciting.
The U.S. men's curling team

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:57.857 size:88% position:44%
beat Sweden to win their
first gold medal ever!

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.059 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.227 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Band plays ]

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
Actually, they were beating
Sweden so bad,

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.831 line:92%
they conceded the match early.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:08.802
Yep, America made Sweden quit in
frustration, or as we call that,

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
the reverse IKEA.
-Hello!

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey!
-Yeah!

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:14.741 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.177 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:17.811 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Come on!

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:18.611 line:92%
-A bit of a scandal, though.

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:22.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess Russian spies hacked
hundreds of computers

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.084 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
at the Olympics.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:26.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which explains why
Hillary Clinton didn't win

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
a single gold medal.
-Really?

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean that's --
really, not one.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:31.224 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Not one.

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:31.758 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you guys see this?
On Saturday,

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.761 size:84% position:42%
an Austrian snowboarder
had a little trouble

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:38.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
when a squirrel ran right
in front of her during a race.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:41.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everyone is okay,
but take a look at this.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.169 line:92%
There she goes there and then --

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.604 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey, yo!

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:48.408
Guys, that squirrel had trained
four years for that moment.

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:50.343 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:53.746 line:92%
♪♪ Some people wait a lifetime ♪♪

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:56.983 line:92%
♪♪ For a moment like this ♪♪

00:01:56.983 --> 00:02:00.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ I can't believe
it's happening ♪♪

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:00.887 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kelly Clarkson is on
the show tonight, you guys.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah!
-Kelly Clarkson!

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:09.996 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:10.930 line:92%
Hey, listen to this, you guys.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mexico's President cancelled
plans for a visit to

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:16.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
the White House after
a tense phone call he had

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.004 size:78% position:39% line:92%
with President Trump.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:20.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
Apparently, Trump spent
the entire call pressing one

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
and yelling,
[ As Trump ] "English!

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.579 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Engl -- representative!

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.581 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Representative!"

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:32.418 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:33.987 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:35.321 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Come on!

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:39.225 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-"Actual human being!"

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:40.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice ]
As I mentioned earlier,

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
several businesses have
cancelled their partnership

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:47.300
with the NRA over the past week,
including United Airlines.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:47.734 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.370
You know you messed up when the
company that dragged the guy off

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
the plane is like,
"You're making us look bad."

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:54.774 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So, uh -- Wow.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.075 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:57.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
Speaking of business,
did you hear about this?

00:02:57.343 --> 00:03:00.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kylie Jenner tweeted
she doesn't like Snapchat,

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.817
and the company stock value fell
$1.3 billion.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:05.385 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience oohs ]

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:07.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
And people were like,
"Yh, could you also tweet that

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:09.055 size:88% position:44% line:92%
you don't like the NRA?"

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:11.391 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:14.928
Get this, the Vegas airport
just installed these boxes

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:17.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you drop off
your weed before flying,

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:18.798 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
no questions asked.

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:20.700 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
But if you're forgetful enough
to bring weed with you

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:25.071
to the airport, you're probably
not going to remember

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:28.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
to drop it off
at the drop-off weed box.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:29.943 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:32.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
Guys, sometimes
it feels like there is nothing

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:32.946 size:84% position:42% line:92%
but bad news out there.

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:35.215
Well, we here at
"The Tonight Show" have decided

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:35.982 line:92%
to do something about that.

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:39.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
We asked real local NBC News
anchors from all around

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:42.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
the country to read stories
that we wish were true,

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:43.623 line:92%
stories that make us feel happy.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:45.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll show you what I mean in
tonight's installment of

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I've got good news,
and good news."

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.363 line:92%
-♪♪ I've got good news ♪♪

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:52.031 size:88% position:44% line:92%
♪♪ I've got good news ♪♪

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:55.602 size:88% position:44% line:92%
♪♪ I've got good news ♪♪

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:57.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm going to read
the next news story like

00:03:57.704 --> 00:04:01.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
my teeth are
Crazy Glued together.

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:04.110 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Mumbling ]

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.546 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:06.546 --> 00:04:09.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The FDA reports
that raw cookie dough is now

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:11.384 line:92%
legally considered a vegetable.

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:14.587
So if anyone judges you for
eating it straight out of

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:17.557 line:92%
the fridge, they're an idiot.

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:18.825 line:92%
-In personal news, check me out!

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:23.496
I'm reading the news with my
eyes closed and I'm nailing it.

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:26.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Two men in ski masks entered
a bank today,

00:04:26.299 --> 00:04:27.667 line:92%
but they weren't robbing it.

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.769 line:92%
They just had cold faces.

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:31.971 line:92%
-In other news, me a big boy.

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:35.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
Me put on suit.
Say big boy words.

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.076 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Me be important.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:38.911 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Me important, yes.

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:40.813 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Big boy important?

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.348 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You betcha.

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:44.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Breaking news.
It's now illegal for anyone

00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:47.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
to call themselves
a model/deejay.

00:04:47.887 --> 00:04:51.157
-Saddle up, gang, because
that's a phrase I say now.

00:04:51.157 --> 00:04:53.326 size:81% position:41%
-Let's take a look at
the five-day forecast.

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:58.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now let's take a look
at my head on a pigeon's body.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:01.367 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Cooing ]

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:03.469
-Oh, come on.
Doesn't that make you feel good?

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:04.337 line:92%
We have a great show tonight.

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:06.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
Give it up for The Roots,
ladies and gentlemen!

